RUNNING THIS PROJECT
====================

A usage walkthrough. README.md is the reference for what the system
does and why; this is how to actually run it. CHANGELOG.md records why
decisions were made.

WHAT CHANGED SINCE THE LAST VERSION OF THIS FILE
------------------------------------------------
It had drifted far enough to be actively misleading, so the corrections
are listed rather than quietly folded in:

  * It said "this codebase has no strategy-id-to-class registry, so map
